  "description": "In a quiet, remote countryside, a seemingly devout priest named Michael lives a peaceful life—until an incubus named Az appears before him. Az threatens to expose Michael's darkest secret unless he offers up his life energy. Left with no choice, Michael spends a night with the demon... only to discover Az's unexpected weakness in the midst of their sinful encounter.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
